        +testUpdateDealViaMockServer(): void
        +testDeleteDealViaMockServer(): void
        +testMockServerErrorResponse(): void
    }

    note right of DealControllerMockServerTest
        <b>MockServer Testing Pattern:</b>
        - Creates LOCAL mock HTTP server
        - Simulates external API endpoints
        - Tests client-side HTTP logic
        - No real external service needed
        - Validates request/response handling

        <b>MockServer Features:</b>
        - mockServerClient.when(request)
        - .respond(response)
        - HTTP method matching
        - Path pattern matching
        - Status code simulation
        - JSON response bodies

        <b>Use Cases:</b>
        - Testing API client code
        - Simulating partner APIs
        - Testing error scenarios
        - Development without external dependencies

        <b>MockServer Test Count: 10 tests</b>
    end note
}

