    note right of DealControllerExternalServerTest
        <b>External API Testing Pattern:</b>
        - Calls REAL external mock API service
        - Endpoint: mock.apidog.com
        - Tests network communication
        - Validates third-party integration
        - Tests latency and performance

        <b>RestAssured Usage:</b>
        RestAssured.baseURI = external_url
        given().when().get().then()

        <b>Differences from MockServer:</b>
        - MockServer: LOCAL mock HTTP server
        - External: REMOTE third-party API
        - MockServer: In-process
        - External: Network communication

        <b>Use Cases:</b>
        - Partner API integration testing
        - API sandbox validation
        - Contract testing
        - Network behavior testing

        <b>External Server Test Count: 10 tests</b>
